[ARDUINO SA OFFICIAL]
Document: Datasheet Arduino Uno R4 WiFi
Microcontroller: Renesas RA4M1 32-bit ARM Cortex-M4 (48MHz)
Connectivity: ESP32-S3-MINI-1 (Wi-Fi 802.11 b/g/n, Bluetooth 5.0)
Operating Voltage: 5V
Input Voltage (recommended): 6-24V
Digital I/O Pins: 14 (6 PWM)
Analog Input Pins: 6
DAC: 1 (12-bit)
CAN Bus: Yes (supported by RA4M1)
Status: Public Technical Documentation
